        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "iLcoe",
          "name": "Back to three lines. The state line goes away: conflicts, ci failing, stacked and draft are facts about the branch, so they read as colored words on the facts line, never as boxes. The pill is the only box on the row, and it never moves. Hover: dot becomes the checkbox, the row tints, and the ticket + copy tools and secondary verbs slide in left of the primary verb, which stays put.",
