        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "xaX7y",
          "name": "A's three lines, borrowing two habits from GitHub's PR list: the review state is a colored dot and a plain word, not a pill, and the right rail is three fixed columns (state · threads · age · verb) so counts line up across rows instead of ragging. Nothing on the row is boxed; color and weight carry every distinction. Hover contract as A.",
