          "fontSize": 20,
          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "U2aWEm",
          "name": "The same hot row (a decide gate on an MR with conflicts and a failing pipeline) drawn five ways. Two axes are in play: how many lines the row spends at rest (2, 3 or 4), and how much of the row is boxed (outlined chips today, one soft pill in A/B/C, nothing in D). Every direction shares one polish pass: a distinct hue per review state (board 01), flags as colored words instead of chips, the author in muted instead of purple, one accent-blue verb per row. Each direction's own board shows all five fixture rows at rest and under hover.",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "content": "The same hot row (a decide gate on an MR with conflicts and a failing pipeline) drawn five ways. Two axes are in play: how many lines the row spends at rest (2, 3 or 4), and how much of the row is boxed (outlined chips today, one soft pill in A/B/C, nothing in D). Every direction shares one polish pass: a distinct hue per review state (board 01), flags as colored words instead of chips, the author in muted instead of purple, one accent-blue verb per row. Each direction's own board shows all five fixture rows at rest and under hover.",
          "fontFamily": "$font-sans",
          "fontSize": 13
        },
