        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "RyjSs",
          "name": "With no lane, gate or social fact, the status line states the MR's standing GitLab state for the board's seat. The author reads what the MR needs from them, in the order they'd fix it; everyone else reads whose move it is. All quiet (no edge bar) except the one work line; only someone else's settled MR earns the sun.",
