        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "DdglP",
          "name": "Shapes taken from the live board: titles to 97 characters, branches to 68, diffs like +8561 −6556, 27,407 commits behind, approvals required up to 12, and a stacked chain. The header line clips from the right, the title from the right, the branch before the diff, so the pill, the diff and the age never move. The last two rows show the author-grouped view, where the author tag is gone: the ticket takes its place, and with no ticket the header holds only the flags.",
