          "fontWeight": "600"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FtyB8",
          "name": "The pill stops saying \"commented\": it owns the approval axis only (needs review, N/M approved, approved, changes requested). The conversation lives in one token on the facts line, the drawer's entry, and it reads at full weight instead of dim. Four states: quiet (count only), new activity since you last opened the drawer (accent, bold, dot), threads awaiting you on your own MR (amber count), and the author replied to your thread on theirs (accent). Hover underlines it like a link.",
          "fill": "$muted",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
